			ShowMysteryAward "LIGHT VILLAIN"
		Case eMysteryBallSave
			ShowMysteryAward "BALL SAVE"
		Case eMysteryBonusX
			ShowMysteryAward "+1 BONUS X"
		Case eMysteryHoldBonusX
			ShowMysteryAward "HOLD BONUS X"
		Case eMysteryAdvBumpers
			ShowMysteryAward "SUPER JETS"
		Case eMysteryAdvSpinner
			ShowMysteryAward "SUPER SPINNER"
